  "needs_audit": [],
  "audit_notes": [
    "1 pala has three different gram values across systems: 60g (Sri Lankan, p.65), 48g (Yauna/Indian, p.477), and 933g/80 = 11.66g × 80 / pala in tolā-system reference (not pala-anchored). The Sri Lankan value is the default for this corpus.",
    "1 māṣa = 1g in Sri Lankan and Yauna; ≈ 0.972g in tolā (slightly different definition).",
    "p.475 'සිර් ස්ටර්ලීන්' (sterling sēr) value of 180 tolā differs from the standard 80 tolā — needs cross-check against the broader pharmacy literature before being treated as authoritative.",
    "Drop-systems on p.476 (bindu chakra and modern-bindu chakra) are not yet encoded; they're rare in the formula corpus and require liquid-density assumptions to compare with mass units."
  ]
